Salzburg has great performances. The soloists in their productions are amazing! You could come next year!</p>\nWhere am I going next? I'm considering China, Russia and Turkey! When can you meet me there?\n<br/><br/>\n- Sally"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le10ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le10ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally in Continental Europe", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Heading Home", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "  The Present Continuous Tense  vs.  The Simple Present Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul>  \t<li>things in general </li> \t<li>things that happen regularly </li> \t<li>things that do not change</li> </ul>   \t\t\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul>  \t<li>something that is happening now </li> \t<li>something that is happening around now </li>  </ul>   \t\t\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I love it here in Amsterdam!<br />  Spend the evening on the deck of a canal boat.<br />   What music do you enjoy?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where am I going next?<br /> I'm considering China, Russia and Turkey!<br />  I am packing my suitcase tonight.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We're traveling through the canals in Amsterdam. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I want to visit some friends.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Zero Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the zero conditional to talk about general truths.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are two parts to the sentence.<br />One part is the condition. The other part is the result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"><br />If  or When + the Simple Present, the Simple Present tense  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Condition </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Result </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you want to see tulips,<br />  If you like opera,<br />  When you win a lottery,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">this is the place to come.<br />  Salzburg has great performances.<br />  traveling is a joy! \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "canal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a channel of water made for boats ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many canals in Amsterdam.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tulip ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a bell shaped flower from a bulb ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  If you want to see tulips, this is the place to come. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "houseboat ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a home on the water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some people in Amsterdam live on houseboats.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "performance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a presentation in a theater ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her performance in the opera is amazing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "soloist ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person who sings or plays alone  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The soloist had a beautiful voice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to look your best ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look as good as you can ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's her first date with Tom and she wants to look her best.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "complete ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "whole; entire ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to book the complete package.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "deck ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a floor between the sides of a ship or boat  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can sit on the deck of the boat and look at the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Tell your partner what things you usually do when you are on vacation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what you do when you return home.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5-7 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about what I do when I am on vacation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Present Simple tense to express things I do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Zero conditional to 